  "policy": "One source-bound centauroid mail shirt. Continuous metal and independent original-body visibility; no anatomy baked into garment and no body-shaped cloth cutouts. Only the original human arm foreground plane may appear above this item; underlying fleece remains below mail.",
  "layer_order": "Original body/head including fleece -> full mail -> y/Y metal detail -> original human-arm foreground overlay. No fleece overlay.",
  "mask_semantics": "White selects original body above full garment; black none; gray geometric coverage. Mask always multiplied by actual source-body alpha.",
  "west_policy": "Mirror east cloth, body and masks together; plain source mail has no handed ornament.",
